export const validDate=value=>{if(typeof value!=='string'||!/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(value))return false;const d=new Date(value+'T12:00:00Z');return !isNaN(d)&&d.toISOString().slice(0,10)===value};
const text=(v,max,label,required=false)=>{if(typeof v!=='string')v='';v=v.trim();if((required&&!v)||v.length>max)throw Error(`${label}: ${required?'enter text, up to':'maximum'} ${max} characters.`);return v};
export function validateReport(input){const status=input.status||'held';if(!['held','cancelled','postponed'].includes(status))throw Error('Choose a valid meeting status.');let participants=Number(input.participants);if(status!=='held')participants=0;if((status==='held'&&(input.participants===''||input.participants===null||input.participants===undefined))||!Number.isInteger(participants)||participants<0||participants>100000)throw Error('Enter a participant count from 0 to 100000.');const teachingRating=status==='held'?Number(input.teachingRating):null;if(status==='held'&&(!Number.isInteger(teachingRating)||teachingRating<1||teachingRating>5))throw Error('Rate the teaching from 1 to 5.');return{organizerName:text(input.organizerName,120,'Organizer name',true),status,participants,teachingRating,teachingFeedback:text(input.teachingFeedback,4000,'Teaching feedback',status==='held'),comments:text(input.comments,6000,'Comments')};}
export function dateRange({month,from,to}){if(month){if(!/^\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])$/.test(month))throw Error('Choose a valid month.');from=month+'-01';const d=new Date(from+'T12:00:00Z');d.setUTCMonth(d.getUTCMonth()+1);d.setUTCDate(0);to=d.toISOString().slice(0,10);}if(!validDate(from)||!validDate(to)||from>to||new Date(to)-new Date(from)>366*86400000)throw Error('Choose a date range of up to one year.');return{from,to};}
export function monthlyReport(meetings,reports,range,today){const{from,to}=dateRange(range),byId=new Map(reports.map(r=>[r.meetingId||r.id,r]));const rows=meetings.filter(m=>m.date>=from&&m.date<=to).sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)||Number(a.id)-Number(b.id)).map(m=>{const r=byId.get(m.id);return{meetingId:m.id,topic:m.topic,date:m.date,startTime:m.startTime||'21:00',reportStatus:r?'Submitted':m.date>today?'Not yet due':'Missing',report:r||null};});const submitted=rows.filter(r=>r.report),held=submitted.filter(r=>r.report.status==='held'),due=rows.filter(r=>r.date<=today),reportedDue=due.filter(r=>r.report);const totalParticipants=held.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.report.participants,0);return{from,to,generatedAt:new Date().toISOString(),summary:{scheduled:rows.length,submitted:submitted.length,missing:due.length-reportedDue.length,upcoming:rows.filter(r=>r.date>today&&!r.report).length,held:held.length,cancelled:submitted.filter(r=>r.report.status==='cancelled').length,postponed:submitted.filter(r=>r.report.status==='postponed').length,totalParticipants,averageParticipants:held.length?Math.round(totalParticipants/held.length*100)/100:null,averageTeachingRating:held.length?Math.round(held.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.report.teachingRating,0)/held.length*100)/100:null,coverage:due.length?Math.round(reportedDue.length/due.length*100):null},rows};}
export const csvCell=value=>{let s=String(value??'');if(/^[\s]*[=+@\-]/.test(s)||/^[\t\r]/.test(s))s="'"+s;return '"'+s.replaceAll('"','""')+'"'};
export function reportCsv(report){const lines=[['Mahber','Meeting date','Dubai start time','Report status','Meeting status','Participants','Teaching rating (1-5)','Organizer','Teaching feedback','Comments','Last updated']];for(const r of report.rows){const p=r.report;lines.push([r.topic,r.date,r.startTime,r.reportStatus,p?.status,p?.participants,p?.teachingRating,p?.organizerName,p?.teachingFeedback,p?.comments,p?.updatedAt]);}return '\ufeff'+lines.map(row=>row.map(csvCell).join(',')).join('\r\n');}
